# Keep the deploy-e2e image context lean. Build output (build/) is NOT
# excluded by accident of omission — it is rebuilt inside the image, and
# excluding stale host artifacts keeps the layer deterministic.
**/node_modules
**/build
.git
coverage
benchmarks/results
docs/.vitepress/cache
docs/.vitepress/dist
examples/api/storage
**/*.log
.env
**/.env
